# Dexerto

> Dexerto is a leading gaming and internet-culture media company, founded in 2015 and reaching over 100 million fans each month. We cover video games, esports, streamers and creators, TV and movies, and the viral moments shaping online culture. Dexerto was named the No.1 gaming media platform by Comscore in 2024, and is a two-time winner of Coverage Platform of the Year at The Esports Awards (2019, 2022). Editorial teams operate across London, Paris, and Chicago.

Original reporting, reviews, guides, and analysis from a named editorial team. Article URLs typically follow `dexerto.com/<vertical-or-game>/<slug>-<id>/`. Many major franchises (Roblox, Pokemon, Fortnite, GTA, Call of Duty, Battlefield, Valorant, and others) have their own top-level paths rather than sitting under `/gaming/`.

